        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The internal system that logs what happens when an ad request comes back empty has been renamed: the fields that recorded the result of the first-party paid ads and the house ads are now called `direct_result` and `house_result`, matching the naming used elsewhere, and the list of plain-English reason codes in the same spot was refreshed. This affects only the Freebuff engineering team, since these are server-side telemetry fields that feed internal dashboards and the durable decision record, not something end users or advertisers configure. You will not notice any change in your coding sessions, ad experience, or account because this is bookkeeping on the server that runs the ads plumbing; the visible behavior of Freebuff is unchanged.",
